{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000014","compactId":"SO_0000014","id":"SO:0000014","label":"INR_motif","definition":{"text":"A sequence element characteristic of some RNA polymerase II promoters required for the correct positioning of the polymerase for the start of transcription. Overlaps the TSS. The mammalian consensus sequence is YYAN(T|A)YY; the Drosophila consensus sequence is TCA(G|T)t(T|C). In each the A is at position +1 with respect to the TSS. Functionally similar to the TATA box element.","xrefs":["PMID:12651739","PMID:16858867"]},"comments":["Binds TAF1, TAF2."],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"INR motif"},{"scope":"exact","value":"initiator"},{"scope":"exact","value":"initiator motif"},{"scope":"related","value":"DMp2"}],"xrefs":[],"subsets":[],"altIds":[],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0000014/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"},"mostRecent":{"hash":"ad4ec85c0c89dbb861aa2555f482ed98b364db23","shortHash":"ad4ec85","date":"2019-07-31","subject":"Updated location of bacterial_RNApol_promoter and added definitions to child terms lacking definition"},"entries":[{"hash":"ad4ec85c0c89dbb861aa2555f482ed98b364db23","shortHash":"ad4ec85","date":"2019-07-31","subject":"Updated location of bacterial_RNApol_promoter and added definitions to child terms lacking definition"},{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"}]},"parents":["SO:0001660"],"children":[],"ancestors":["SO:0001660","SO:0002309","SO:0001659","SO:0000713","SO:0000714","SO:0001683","SO:0001411","SO:0000001","SO:0000110"],"descendants":[],"relationships":[{"predicate":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/so#part_of","target":"SO:0001669"}],"graphNeighborhood":{"parents":["http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001660